.TH DANBY-THREEBODY 1
.SH NAME
danby-threebody \- mutual gravitational motion of three bodies
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/threebody
.SH MODEL
All three finite masses accelerate under every pairwise Newtonian interaction.
The initial equilateral rotating configuration can be perturbed in velocity to
show regular motion giving way to close encounters and sensitive trajectories.
.SH DISPLAY
Colour-coded trails show all three paths.  Total energy and angular momentum
are plotted as integration diagnostics.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/threebody.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR orbital (2)
